          "line1": "<h1><span class=\"fontsize-4vw\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">How to help avoid potential challenges associated with&nbsp;<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\">Direct Anterior approach</span></span></span></span></span></h1>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 17 2025 15:15:26 GMT+0000",
