          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 25 2022 18:46:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Program objectives</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand some of the common complications with Direct Anterior approach and how Stryker’s DART™ (Direct Anterior Reconstructive Technology) portfolio may offer solutions for your cases</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand how to identify some of the common complications with Direct Anterior approach</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand potential ways to help troubleshoot and address some of the common complications when doing Direct Anterior approach</span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 17 2025 15:22:26 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
